how do legacy plugin extended resources handle requests in init containers and main containers?

I *think* this would count as allocating 3, but would need to split usage of the 3 differently between initContainer (all 3 into a single container) and container (1 per container)
```
initContainers:
- resources: {requests: {example.com/gpu: 3}}
containers:
