- resources: {requests: {example.com/gpu: 3}}
containers:
- resources: {requests: {example.com/gpu: 1}}
- resources: {requests: {example.com/gpu: 1}}
```

Does this mean we need to request devices for non-sidecar initContainers in a more granular way so we can remap/reuse them for later initContainers / later sidecar initContainers / main containers?

